se  the body administration has tied the  hands of both the border patrol as well  as ice they have insufficient number of  personnel on the border to secure the  border and that's exactly why texas has  10 000 national guard and texas  department of public safety officers on  the border that's why we are erecting  these barriers on the border and it's  exactly why texas is building its own  border wall  which  exactly and one of my sources told me  about the lawlessness happening in in  houston he told me there are 400 000 new  people in houston right now because  there are getaway cars picking them up  from the border driving them to houston  in fact i was told one of the biggest  businesses in houston right now is  producing fake documents that these  companies that produce fake documents  for these illegals are just soaring  what's going on in houston and by the  way a federal judge is insisting that  the biden administration re-implement  remain in mexico but my sources on the  ground said i'll believe it when i see  it they still think they're going to  blow off the law your thoughts on what's  going on in houston as well as this  remaining mexico policy real quick sir  so the remaining mexico that was the  result of a lawsuit brought by texas  against the body administration where a  federal judge ruled in our favor  compelling the body administration to  reinstate the remaining mexico policy of  course we are apprehensive about the  extent to which the administration will  reimpose it however the news reports are  that they are going to begin doing it i  think they have gotten  agreement by the mexican government to  begin that process beginning this  weekend in early next week but of course  as usual we'll believe it when we see it  with regard to these uh crimes that  you're talking about taking place  listen this is part of cartel activity  the cartels are advertising on tick-tock  to get drivers to assist in them moving  illegal immigrants around the state of  texas it's an issue that the texas  department of public safety is working  to crack down upon but it shows the  extent to which texas law enforcement  officers have to step up and deal with  the challenges that are created by the  by demonstration importing illegal  activity into our country and into our  state  all right we will leave it there  governor thanks very much for your  leadership good to talk with you this  morning  we have reported on the tick tock angle  as well thank you sir

